and professional authority. Support staff

124
00:10:26,295 --> 00:10:31,633
can see power from more than one position.
A family may see you as part of

125
00:10:31,634 --> 00:10:37,485
the school, while inside the school you
may have less say in a decision. That can

126
00:10:37,486 --> 00:10:43,336
help you notice an imbalance others miss.
We work within education every day. Its

127
00:10:43,337 --> 00:10:48,529
language and routines can feel ordinary to
us, while being unfamiliar or

128
00:10:48,530 --> 00:10:54,235
intimidating to someone else. Think about
