questions. Who sets the agenda? Whose
knowledge is heard? Who can make

153
00:12:59,704 --> 00:13:03,929
decisions? What can the school change
about the process? Power can be

154
00:13:03,930 --> 00:13:08,279
structural, historical and cultural. It
can also operate without anyone

155
00:13:08,280 --> 00:13:13,251
